  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The given series is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math>, then we can write as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math></p><p>Subtracting above equations, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>40</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>40</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>40</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>4800</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>40</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2345</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>30</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>30</mn></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>30</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>30</mn></munderover><mfenced><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>30</mn></munderover><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>30</mn></munderover><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mn>30</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>31</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>61</mn></mfenced></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mn>30</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>31</mn></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>30</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>13635</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>30</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>40</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>13635</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2345</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11290</mn></math></p><p>Therefore, the required value is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11290</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>"
